---
// Talking to the CMO: a question about the numbers, an answer from them, and
// a campaign proposed on a card you approve.
---
<div class="chat-card" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="chat-top"><span class="dot"><span></span></span><b>Seemo</b><small>CMO · Acme Bakery</small></div>
  <div class="msg you">Signups are flat this month. What's going on?</div>
  <div class="msg seemo">Traffic is up 18%, but 70% of it lands on the pricing guide, which has no trial link. Search Console shows 340 searches for “bakery pos comparison” where you rank 14th.</div>
  <div class="msg seemo">I'd fix the guide today and run a campaign on comparisons for four weeks.</div>
  <div class="proposal">
    <div class="p-head"><span class="kind">Campaign</span><span class="for">for: More trial signups</span></div>
    <b>Comparison pages</b>
    <ul><li>3 articles to WordPress</li><li>6 LinkedIn posts, 2 a week</li><li>Trial link on the pricing guide</li></ul>
    <div class="acts"><span class="ok">Approve</span><span>Change</span></div>
  </div>
</div>
